  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, add the water and bring to\n• the boil. Add the basmati rice, stir, cover with a lid\n• and reduce the heat to low. Cook for 10 minutes,\n• then remove the pan from the heat and keep\n• covered until the rice is tender and the water is\n• absorbed, 10 minutes.\n• TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam so\n• don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60daa8e5788c5c7a1d2ecdfe/step-3dd8f1f2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the rice is cooking, finely chop the brown\n• onion. Finely chop the garlic. Grate the carrot.\n• Slice the corn kernels from the cob. Roughly chop\n• the tomato and coriander.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60daa8e5788c5c7a1d2ecdfe/step-a4721bb7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a small bowl, combine the tomato, coriander\n• and white wine vinegar. Drizzle with olive oil and\n• season with salt and pepper. Toss\n• to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60daa8e5788c5c7a1d2ecdfe/step-9c89823f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil\n• over a medium-high heat. Cook the onion, grated\n• carrot and corn, stirring, until softened,\n• 4-6 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60daa8e5788c5c7a1d2ecdfe/step-9534274f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• SPICY! The Mexican Fiesta spice blend is a little\n• spicy, add less if you're sensitive to heat! Add the\n• plant-based mince to the pan and cook, breaking\n• up with a spoon, 2-3 minutes. Add the butter,\n• garlic, tomato paste and Mexican Fiesta spice\n• blend and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add the diced tomatoes with garlic & onion\n• and vegetable stock powder and simmer,\n• 1-2 minutes. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60daa8e5788c5c7a1d2ecdfe/step-3fe29550.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the rice between bowls and top with the\n• chilli sin carne. Top with the shredded Cheddar\n• cheese and the tomato and coriander salsa. Serve\n• with the light sour cream.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60daa8e5788c5c7a1d2ecdfe/step-4402f6a6.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
